WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.277
Covering space with convex bodies.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.482
Copies of a shape cover the plane; overlaps

3
00:00:05.482 --> 00:00:07.741
are waste. How much waste is unavoidable?

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.642
A body carved by random caps defeats every periodic covering.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.478
Claimed: order n log n, both ways.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.227
Main theorem Lean-checked.
